1 Terminology
*************

When keybindings (shortcurts) are defined, the following legend applies
(a la Emacs):

term   meaning
-----------------------------------
‘s’    Super / Windows / CMD key
‘S’    Shift key
‘M’    Meta / Alt / Option key
‘C’    Control key


